  "comments": [
    {
      "id": "comment_sales_1",
      "text": "### Executive Sales KPIs\n- Auto Field optimizes incoming types automatically.\n- Data Clean trims whitespace and title-cases region names.\n- DateTime normalizes dates into ISO format.\n- Formula calculates Net Revenue after discounts.\n- High-value transactions (> $500) are aggregated by Region and Segment.",
